      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=LEAD: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.first_name }} {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.last_name }} | {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.job_title }} | {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_name }} | {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.lead_email || $('Alta Normalize').first().json.linkedin_url }}\nSOURCE: Alta ({{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_channel }} reply)\nEMAIL TYPE: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.is_freemail ? 'PERSONAL/FREEMAIL, the domain is the email provider, NOT the company; web-search the real company + phone' : ($('Alta Normalize').first().json.lead_email ? 'business domain' : 'no email, LinkedIn lead') }}\nLOCATION: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.city }}, {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.state }}, {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.country_code }}\nDOMAIN: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.domain }}\nLINKEDIN: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.linkedin_url }}\n\nCOMPANY DATA (from Alta enrichment; fields may be missing, verify with web search):\nindustry: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_industry }} | size: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_size }} | revenue: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_revenue }} | founded: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_founded }} | HQ: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_hq }}\nDescription: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_description }}\nTechnologies: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.company_tech }}\n\nCONTACT ENRICHMENT (may be empty):\nphone: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.native_phone }} | seniority: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.seniority }} | title: {{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.job_title }}\n\nPROSPECT LATEST REPLY:\n{{ $('Alta Normalize').first().json.reply_text }}\n\nRun the qualification. Output structured JSON.",
